Error [E0346]: `@Meta` repeats `category`
  --> tests/ui/meta_duplicate_field.jet:2:33
    |
  2 |     @Meta(category: "Movement", category: "Physics")
    |                                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `category` has one value; writing it twice would make tooling choose between two labels
 Fix: keep one `category: "..."` field
